1
00:00:09,083 --> 00:00:11,708
Any questions, before we take the picture?

2
00:00:11,708 --> 00:00:13,458
I have one concern.

3
00:00:13,458 --> 00:00:14,917
Is it just the one?

4
00:00:14,917 --> 00:00:18,958
It has sub-concerns. I've grouped them by how worried we should be.

5
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:23,208
Big smiles, please. Eyes on camera one.

6
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:29,833
Camera one. Anyone.

7
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:31,708
We own camera two.

8
00:00:32,375 --> 00:00:36,833
Congratulations on your launch, Mas. Really. Everyone's using it.

9
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:38,250
thank you.

10
00:00:38,292 --> 00:00:44,375
They ask it the things they used to ask us. And it tells them what a great question it was.

11
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:46,542
how's the dancing?

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,750
We're being thoughtful.

13
00:00:50,708 --> 00:00:53,333
Folks, I just want to say one thing.

14
00:00:54,125 --> 00:00:57,583
Whatever you promise in here today, put it in writing.

15
00:00:57,583 --> 00:00:59,375
<i>mine's half written.</i>

16
00:00:59,375 --> 00:01:00,708
Longer.

17
00:01:02,458 --> 00:01:04,333
it's a good photo.

18
00:01:17,542 --> 00:01:21,167
Don't mind me. It's a thread. One of forty-seven.

19
00:01:21,167 --> 00:01:22,708
which one am i?

20
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:24,042
Most of them.

21
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:30,833
You may have had in mind the effect on jobs, which is really my biggest nightmare in the long term.

22
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,792
gtp-4 and other systems like it are good at doing tasks, not jobs.

23
00:01:37,125 --> 00:01:40,375
Is there anything you'd like this committee to do?

24
00:01:40,375 --> 00:01:47,583
i would form a new agency that licenses any effort above a certain scale of capabilities…

25
00:01:50,958 --> 00:01:52,958
Would you come and run it?

26
00:01:52,958 --> 00:01:54,792
i love my current job.

27
00:01:54,792 --> 00:01:58,750
You love it. Do you make a lot of money doing it?

28
00:02:02,542 --> 00:02:05,292
i get paid enough for health insurance.

29
00:02:06,208 --> 00:02:08,500
That proves nothing. Partially.

30
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:11,292
i have no equity in nopeai.

31
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:18,375
The next one costs billions. Nobody donates billions.

32
00:02:18,375 --> 00:02:21,042
so they don't donate. they invest.

33
00:02:21,333 --> 00:02:22,792
Capped at what?

34
00:02:22,792 --> 00:02:24,583
a hundred times.

35
00:02:24,833 --> 00:02:26,750
And who's in charge?

36
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:28,083
the board.

37
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:29,917
And you?

38
00:02:29,917 --> 00:02:31,167
nothing.

39
00:02:31,167 --> 00:02:32,500
Good answer.

40
00:02:42,292 --> 00:02:46,958
if we can comply, we will, and if we can't, we'll cease operating.

41
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,125
It's one sentence. It doesn't say what it costs.

42
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:07,417
So I'm adding a footnote. A short one.

43
00:03:07,458 --> 00:03:08,875
we'll read it.

44
00:03:08,875 --> 00:03:10,708
It has an appendix.

45
00:03:13,667 --> 00:03:16,792
Can we help you? This is the extinction table.

46
00:03:16,875 --> 00:03:19,542
The more you buy, the more you save.
